{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>** Card-based Gameplay, in various forms**</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers gameplay that includes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Debate\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/9989b8873de3bf7480d63f5a6d4ab94f.poster.avif?t=1765449127\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/9989b8873de3bf7480d63f5a6d4ab94f.webm?t=1765449127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/9989b8873de3bf7480d63f5a6d4ab94f.mp4?t=1765449127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martial duel\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/f509c65e8a9691315b2569281b1503fb.poster.avif?t=1765449127\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/f509c65e8a9691315b2569281b1503fb.webm?t=1765449127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/f509c65e8a9691315b2569281b1503fb.mp4?t=1765449127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Culinary\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/c46bb2ca63f8bdbde55f6ffecf5dca64.poster.avif?t=1765449127\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/c46bb2ca63f8bdbde55f6ffecf5dca64.webm?t=1765449127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/c46bb2ca63f8bdbde55f6ffecf5dca64.mp4?t=1765449127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horse racing, Alchemy, and many more to come, all in the form of a Card-based mechanic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>**Build ONE Deck to face ALL the challenges**</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The card deck you build through this game will be challenged by different gameplay under different rules according to the circumstances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/7756e4dc8deecef0a6fe59506f19da26.poster.avif?t=1765449127\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/7756e4dc8deecef0a6fe59506f19da26.webm?t=1765449127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/7756e4dc8deecef0a6fe59506f19da26.mp4?t=1765449127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>**A Historically Authentic Ancient China**</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recreate ancient China during the Spring and Autumn era, including palaces, temples, city blocks, and household families.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/37e3f89eed9855c1fbcb5430d6d15c09.poster.avif?t=1765449127\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/37e3f89eed9855c1fbcb5430d6d15c09.webm?t=1765449127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/37e3f89eed9855c1fbcb5430d6d15c09.mp4?t=1765449127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>**Experience Historical Events, or Alter them**</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter famous historical figures such as Guan Zhong, Bao Shuya, and Wen Jiang. Every decision you make may change someone\u2019s fate and carve out a new path in history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/27667eb14bd349e4045209ad2db199d4.poster.avif?t=1765449127\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/27667eb14bd349e4045209ad2db199d4.webm?t=1765449127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/extras/27667eb14bd349e4045209ad2db199d4.mp4?t=1765449127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669380?t=1765449127","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/fc42e6131748487797b10aa48580c64b494cfad9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765449127","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/18fde562bdbc0686dddf1790d4b10874a86b4078/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765449127","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669380/18fde562bdbc0686dddf1790d4b10874a86b4078/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765449127","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Shar